# .env.production IS committed: it holds only public addresses and a public
# RPC, no credentials. See the file header.
!/.env.production

# Art source material. These are the full-resolution generations and the
# keyed intermediates -- 33MB of 1024px originals that the shipped game never
# reads. public/art/ holds the resized, game-ready set (686KB) and IS committed,
# because that is what the bundle serves.
art-src/
src/assets/

# Unreleased economy spec. This is the working design for the tool/gem economy
# -- tier names, prices, drop tables, repair costs, the 90% redemption spread,
# the 0.005 ETH redemption floor. It is deliberately NOT committed: it contains
# pricing that is still moving, and shipping the repo would put unreleased
# numbers in front of anyone who reads the tree. Kept local so it survives
# across sessions; gitignored so it cannot leak by accident.
ECONOMY-SPEC.md
.env
